  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Mini-Kode is an educational project to help developers understand modern coding-agent architecture, described as a complete yet manageable implementation of about 14K lines of production code. The product is invoked as the mini-kode command; it supports an interactive mode (bare command) and a non-interactive mode that executes a task supplied as a quoted argument.",
